### duplication before the file redirection
make 2>&1 > build.log
>>> SC2069 1:6

### last pipeline stage with the bad order
dmesg | grep -i error 2>&1 >/dev/null
>>> SC2069 1:23

### file redirection first is fine
make > build.log 2>&1
>>> none

### non last pipeline stage is fine
make 2>&1 >/dev/null | grep -i warning
>>> none

### inside an assigned command substitution is fine
errors=$(make 2>&1 >/dev/null)
>>> SC2034 1:1

### inside a process substitution read from is fine
read -r first_err < <(make 2>&1 >/dev/null)
>>> SC2034 1:9

### duplication applied to a whole brace group is fine
{ make > build.log; } 2>&1
>>> none
